  "description": "It was love at first sight for high school student Jaemin when he saw Sooji. After confessing to Sooji, they started dating, but the problem is, Sooji ignores Jaemin and games all day. For their three year anniversary, Jaemin wants to do this(?) and that(!) with Sooji, so he suggests Sooji a game... a game where you earn points to win a prize; a prize where you can ask the opponent to grant you a wish! Will Jaemin be able to have the lovey dovey relationship he desires with his gaming addict boyfriend?\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
